{"about_the_game":"Affogato is a RPG revolving around a sorceress juggling with the running of her new caf\u00e9, managing her debts, meeting customers from all walks of life and ultimately helping them overcome their greatest fears and secrets by burrowing deep into their minds. Enjoy a story rich RPG featuring an innovative 'reverse tower defense' mechanic and beautiful anime graphics. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_1--EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/1-EN.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Make critical decisions to help your customers defeat their inner demons by entering their minds and leading them to safety through challenging card-based reverse tower defense levels. Choose your routes and cards wisely or lose your customers forever!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_2-EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/---\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Get to know customers from all walks of life. Lend them a listening ear, hear their stories, step into their minds and help them resolve their troubles. Forge special bonds with those you feel an affinity toward and become the approachable sorceress you've always aspired to be.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_3-EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/4-EN.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Plan each day with care and manage your time wisely. Will you focus on bringing in moolah for your caf\u00e9, honing your skills as a barista, learning stronger spells or bridging closer bonds with your customers? Remember that the clock is ticking and that every decision you make costs time in Affogato!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_4-EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/3---\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Making a good cup of coffee is the cornerstone of being a barista. To be a truly great barista, however, you need to understand your customers and figure out which brews are perfect for them. Affogato features realistic coffeemaking simulation. Master the art of making great coffee and you can unlock hidden conversations and storylines!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Good Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/2ba6f9a9a0ba8e082b65e16f92955ee4ede87d11.jpg"},{"name":"Classic Amnesia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/19b7bd86c104317cff191c57ed0440f587bfa930.jpg"},{"name":"The Girl Who Loves Cola","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/9f823b672356ee0e947fd548b8d867a42c0d9ff9.jpg"},{"name":"You Are The One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/bd15e8555e04f3be37f7386cc36451952fdece26.jpg"},{"name":"Careful Calculations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/611315d8cd222ee84f1c2eb7630ccd224461039d.jpg"},{"name":"Mess With Time, Time Messes With You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/53ce5eb32c4583ea340913b88a84142187416d38.jpg"},{"name":"The Number One Witch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/fd5a85abcd5831eb5a001afebd217446ee0d241a.jpg"},{"name":"Change of Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/3c1d45f1235b412119f61584593cb928205bc741.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Delivery Person","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/df1bfbc0bbef4c2a22af4fcb95866452f7d2d013.jpg"},{"name":"A Witch's Retirement Plan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1983970/8875229493ce7b2624b1f4a2bff8ac83ba611971.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1983970?t=1732718549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1732718549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1732718549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1732718549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join Us On Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Affogato is a RPG revolving around a sorceress juggling with the running of her new caf\u00e9, managing her debts, meeting customers from all walks of life and ultimately helping them overcome their greatest fears and secrets by burrowing deep into their minds. Enjoy a story rich RPG featuring an innovative 'reverse tower defense' mechanic and beautiful anime graphics. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_1--EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/1-EN.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Make critical decisions to help your customers defeat their inner demons by entering their minds and leading them to safety through challenging card-based reverse tower defense levels. Choose your routes and cards wisely or lose your customers forever!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_2-EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/---\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Get to know customers from all walks of life. Lend them a listening ear, hear their stories, step into their minds and help them resolve their troubles. Forge special bonds with those you feel an affinity toward and become the approachable sorceress you've always aspired to be.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_3-EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/4-EN.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Plan each day with care and manage your time wisely. Will you focus on bringing in moolah for your caf\u00e9, honing your skills as a barista, learning stronger spells or bridging closer bonds with your customers? Remember that the clock is ticking and that every decision you make costs time in Affogato!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/\u753b\u677f_4-EN.png?t=1732718549\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/extras/3---\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1732718549\" /><br><br>Making a good cup of coffee is the cornerstone of being a barista. To be a truly great barista, however, you need to understand your customers and figure out which brews are perfect for them. Affogato features realistic coffeemaking simulation. Master the art of making great coffee and you can unlock hidden conversations and storylines!","developers":["Befun Studio"],"dlc":[2538820],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983970/header.jpg?t=1732718549","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Befun Studio, all rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256964100,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256964100/movie480.mp4?t=1692258053","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256964100/movie_max.mp4?t=1692258053"},"name":"launch EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256964100/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1692258053","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256964100/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1692258053","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256964100/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1692258053"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256933420,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256933420/movie480.mp4?t=1692258719","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256933420/movie_max.mp4?t=1692258719"},"name":"Steam fest trailer EN (Wishlist on Steam)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256933420/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1692258719","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256933420/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1692258719","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256933420/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1692258719"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256910693,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256910693/movie480.mp4?t=1692258727","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic